    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Maya's School Club Page\r\n\r\n*\"I asked for a colorful page but it looks like a rainbow exploded! Every single thing is a different color. That's not what I meant at all. I wanted it to feel fun and bright, not chaotic.\"*\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. **Investigate:** Read Maya's `vision.md` to understand what they originally asked for.\r\n2. **Fix it:** Use AI Tutor to clean up the page. You can:\r\n   - **Update the Vision:** Edit `vision.md` with clearer instructions, then ask AI Tutor to rebuild, **or**\r\n   - **Prompt & Refine:** Tell AI Tutor to fix specific issues step by step, **or**\r\n   - **Do Both!**.\r\n\r\n> **Hint:** Think about how you can clarify what \"colorful\" means using specific color terms you've learned - like color names for specific elements.\r\n\r\nWhen the page matches Maya's feedback, click **Continue**.",
